labels/priority/P2","name":"priority/P2","color":"dd7172","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignee":{"login":"jtattermusch","id":9939684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5Mzk2ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9939684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch","html_url":"https://github.com/jtattermusch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"jtattermusch","id":9939684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5Mzk2ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9939684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch","html_url":"https://github.com/jtattermusch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2019-10-24T13:01:02Z","updated_at":"2020-02-04T19:27:17Z","closed_at":"2019-11-06T18:26:59Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### What version of gRPC and what language are you using?\r\n2.23.1 & 2.24.0\r\n\r\n### What operating system (Linux, Windows,...) and version?\r\nWindows 10 v1803\r\n\r\n### What runtime / compiler are you using (e.g. python version or version of gcc)\r\nMSBuild VS 2019 (16.3.5)\r\n\r\n### What did you do?\r\nI tried to have a library targeting the minimum version possible (2.23.1) and an application overwriting the target to latest version possible (2.24.0).\r\n\r\n### What did you expect to see?\r\nThe application should start. All Grpc DLLs (managed + unmanaged) should be from 2.24.0.\r\n\r\n### What did you see instead?\r\n`**System.MissingMethodException:** The native method \"grpcsharp_slice_buffer_create\" does not exist`\r\n\r\nWhen checking the DLLs, the windows native DLLs are not correctly copied.\r\n\r\nThis image shows, that when only targeting 2.23.1 (left, test-23) and 2.24.0 (right, test-24) without changing the version in the app, all files are different.\r\n![grafik](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/940619/67487453-45d60480-f66e-11e9-9e53-d9421ab3b31f.png)\r\n\r\nThe output of 2.24.0 (app) over 2.23.1 (lib) looks like here on the left. The only files matching with 2.23.1 are the windows files.\r\n![grafik](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/940619/67487433-35be2500-f66e-11e9-92d0-b80f7fccbf91.png)\r\n\r\nThe output of 2.24.0 (app) over 2.23.1 (lib) again on the left. The only files NOT matching with 2.24.1 are the windows files.\r\n![grafik](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/940619/67487444-3eaef680-f66e-11e9-9174-84d83c8a1b6a.png)\r\n\r\nSo there seems to be a bug, that the windows libraries are not taken from the correct version. The Linux libraries are taken from the correct version. So there might be a bug in the NuGET script. I sadly don't know enough about NuGET to look further for the reason why this appears.\r\n\r\n### Anything else we should know about your project / environment?\r\nThis bug was already discovered by another user in #19211 but not followed up. Having different version in library and application is common, so this should be fixed to always work.\r\n\r\nThis occured on https://github.com/opentracing-contrib/csharp-grpc/tree/Falco20019/updated-dependencies but I also made a minimal example at https://github.com/Falco20019/test-net461-bug","closed_by":{"login":"jtattermusch","id":9939684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5Mzk2ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9939684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch","html_url":"https://github.com/jtattermusch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jtattermusch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/20782/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc/issues/20782/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}